# Configuration binding

Bind and validate the sections the service requires at startup. Inject the resulting options into the components that use them. Here, `StorageOptions` is the service's options type and `Endpoint` is a required URI string.

```csharp
builder.Services.AddOptions<StorageOptions>()
    .Bind(builder.Configuration.GetRequiredSection("Storage"))
    .Validate(options => Uri.TryCreate(options.Endpoint, UriKind.Absolute, out _),
        "Укажите полный адрес хранилища.")
    .ValidateOnStart();
```
